# AI Contributor Specification

> **Version:** {{specVersion}} · **Owner:** _Set per adopting repository_ · **License:** [CC BY 4.0](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/) · **Change history:** [`CHANGELOG.md`](CHANGELOG.md)
